ear to the Vedas and the Katebas respectively.','kyqy byid ibAws kir keI kqyb muhMmd Xwrw[','kyqy byid ibAws kir keI kqyb muhMmd Xwrw[','ਕੇਤੇ ਬੇਦਿ ਬਿਆਸ ਕਰਿ ਕਈ ਕਤੇਬ ਮੁਹੰਮਦ ਯਾਰਾ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"He has created many a dear personality such as Vedavyas and Muhammad dear to the Vedas and the Katebas respectively.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"kete bedh biaas kar kiee kateb muha(n)madh yaaraa|\",\"hi\":\"केते बेदि बिआस करि कई कतेब मुहंमद यारा।\",\"ipa\":\"ket̪e bed̪ bɪəɑs kər kei kət̪eb mʊhəŋməd̪ jɑrɑ.\",\"ur\":\"کےتے بےد بآس کر کای کتےب مُهںمد ےارا۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,4,'B',',107,098,098,107,107,107,109,088,','kq bd bAs kr ke kqb mhmd Xr','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','kbbkkkmy','kete bedh biaas kar kiee kateb muha(n)madh yaaraa|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200037,'The four Ages (yugs) were established and the first three were given names Satyug, Treta, Dvapar. Fourth one was Kaliyug.','cwir juig kir Qwpnw siqjug qRyqw duAwpru swjy[','cwir juig kir Qwpnw siqjug qRyqw duAwpru swjy[','ਚਾਰਿ ਜੁਗਿ ਕਰਿ ਥਾਪਨਾ ਸਤਿਜੁਗ ਤ੍ਰੇਤਾ ਦੁਆਪਰੁ ਸਾਜੇ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"The four Ages (yugs) were established and the first three were given names Satyug, Treta, Dvapar. Fourth one was Kaliyug.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"chaar jug kar thaapanaa satijug tretaa dhuaapar saaje|\",\"hi\":\"चारि जुगि करि थापना सतिजुग त्रेता दुआपरु साजे।\",\"ipa\":\"t͡ʃɑr d͡ʒʊG kər t̪ʰɑpənɑ sət̪ɪd͡ʒʊG t̪ɹet̪ɑ d̪ʊəɑpər sɑd͡ʒe.\",\"ur\":\"چار جُگ کر تھاپنا ستِجگ ترےتا دُآپر ساجے۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,5,'B',',099,106,107,081,115,113,100,115,','cr jg kr Qpn sqjg qq dApr sj',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','cjktstds','chaar jug kar thaapanaa satijug tretaa dhuaapar saaje|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200040,'Metaphysics (The story is there in the eleventh canto of the Bhagvat Purana), and nothing but one 