) also complements them.','ijau kir kiQAw cwir byid Kit swsiqR sMig swK suxwvY[','ijau kir kiQAw cwir byid Kit swsiqR sMig swK suxwvY[','ਜਿਉ ਕਰਿ ਕਥਿਆ ਚਾਰਿ ਬੇਦਿ ਖਟਿ ਸਾਸਤ੍ਰਿ ਸੰਗਿ ਸਾਖ ਸੁਣਾਵੈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"As the four Vedas have been defined, the description of the six philosophies (Shastras) also complements them.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"jiau kar kathiaa chaar bedh khaT saasatr sa(n)g saakh sunaavai|\",\"hi\":\"जिउ करि कथिआ चारि बेदि खटि सासतृ संगि साख सुणावै।\",\"ipa\":\"d͡ʒɪo kər kət̪ʰɪəɑ t͡ʃɑr bed̪ kʰəʈ sɑsət̪ɪɹ səŋG sɑkʰ sʊɳɑʋæ.\",\"ur\":\"جِا کر کتھِآ چار بےد کھٹِ ساستر سںگ ساکھ سُناوَے۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,8,'B',',106,107,107,099,098,075,115,115,115,115,','ja kr kQA cr bd Kt ssq sg sK sxv',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','jkkcbkssss','jiau kar kathiaa chaar bedh khaT saasatir sa(n)g saakh sunaavai|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200073,'Speculating seriously, seer Gotama has put forth the story of the Rgveda.','goqim qpy ibcwir kY irig vyd kI kQw suxweI[','goqim qpy ibcwir kY irig vyd kI kQw suxweI[','ਗੋਤਮਿ ਤਪੇ ਬਿਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਰਿਗਿ ਵੇਦ ਕੀ ਕਥਾ ਸੁਣਾਈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"Speculating seriously, seer Gotama has put forth the story of the Rgveda.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"gotam tape bichaar kai rig vedh kee kathaa sunaiee|\",\"hi\":\"गोतमि तपे बिचारि कै रिगि वेद की कथा सुणाई।\",\"ipa\":\"Gɔt̪əm t̪əpe bɪt͡ʃɑr kæ rɪG ʋed̪ ki kət̪ʰɑ sʊɳɑei.\",\"ur\":\"گوتم تپے بچار کَے رگ وےد کی کتھا سُناای۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,9,'B',',103,113,098,107,114,118,107,107,115,','gqm qp bcr k rg vd k kQ sxe','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','gtbkrvkks','gotam tape bichaar kai rig vedh kee kathaa sunaiee|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200076,'He is in the beginning and at the end of this creation yet in this Shastra he is shown as separate from this creation.','duhI isrI krqwru hY Awip inAwrw kir idKlweI[','duhI isrI krqwru hY Awip inAwrw kir idKlweI[','ਦੁਹੀ ਸਿਰੀ ਕਰਤਾਰੁ ਹੈ ਆਪਿ ਨਿਆਰਾ ਕਰਿ ਦਿਖਲਾਈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"He is in the beginning and at the end of this creation yet in this Shastra he is shown as separate from this creation.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"dhuhee siree karataar hai aap niaaraa kar dhikhalaiee|\",\"hi\":\"दुही सिरी करतारु है आपि निआरा करि दिखलाई।\",\"ipa\":\"d̪ʊhi sɪri kərət̪ɑr hæ əɑp nɪəɑrɑ kər d̪ɪkʰəlɑei.\",\"ur\":\"دُهی سری کرتار هَے آپ نآرا کر دکھلاای۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,9,'B',',100,115,107,104,065,110,107,100,','dh sr krqr h Ap nAr kr dKle','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','dskhankd','dhuhee siree karataar hai aap niaaraa kar dhikhalaiee|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200079,'The Rgveda exhorts the knowledgeable people that supreme Lord is everything and none else can be compared with Him.','irig khY suix gurmuKhu Awpy Awip n dUjI rweI[','irig khY suix gurmuKhu Awpy Awip n dUjI rweI[','ਰਿਗਿ ਕਹੈ ਸੁਣਿ ਗੁਰਮੁਖਹੁ ਆਪੇ ਆਪਿ ਨ ਦੂਜੀ ਰਾਈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"The Rgveda exhorts the knowledgeable people that supreme Lord is everything and none else can be compared with Him.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"rig kahai sun gurmukhahu aape aap na dhoojee raiee|\",\"hi\":\"रिगि कहै सुणि गुरमुखहु आपे आपि न दूजी राई।\",\"ipa\":\"rɪG kəhæ sʊɳ Gʊrəmʊkʰəh əɑpe əɑp nə d̪ud͡ʒi rɑei.\",\"ur\":\"رِگ کهَے سُن گُرمکھهُ آپے آپ ن دُوجی راای۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,9,'B',',114,107,115,103,065,065,110,100,114,','rg kh sx grmKh Ap Ap n dj re','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','rksgaandr','rig kahai sun guramukhahu aape aap na dhoojee raiee|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200082,'Pondering deeply over the Yajurveda, rishi Jaimini putforth his postulates.','iPir jYmin irKu boilAw jujr vyid miQ kQw suxwvY[','iPir jYmin irKu boilAw jujr vyid miQ kQw suxwvY[','