\": {\"bdb\": \"Analytical wisdom creates the supreme delight and the illusions of birth and death come to an end.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"giaan mate sukh uoopajai janam maran kaa bharam chukaiee|\",\"hi\":\"गिआनु मते सुखु ऊपजै जनम मरन का भरमु चुकाई।\",\"ipa\":\"Gɪəɑn mət̪e sʊkʰ oupəd͡ʒæ d͡ʒənəm mərən kɑ ɓərəm t͡ʃʊkɑei.\",\"ur\":\"گِآن متے سُکھ اُوپجَے جنم مرن کا بھرم چُکاای۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,12,'B',',103,109,115,097,106,109,107,066,099,','gAn mq sK apj jnm mrn k Brm cke','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','gmsujmkbc','giaan mate sukh uoopajai janam maran kaa bharam chukaiee|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200109,'By churning of the Athatvaveda, the guru-oriented (Kanad) in his Vaisesik recited about gunas, the qualities (of the matter).','byd AQrbnu mQin kir gurmuiK bwsyiKk gun gwvY[','byd AQrbnu mQin kir gurmuiK bwsyiKk gun gwvY[','ਬੇਦ ਅਥਰਬਨੁ ਮਥਨਿ ਕਰਿ ਗੁਰਮੁਖਿ ਬਾਸੇਖਿਕ ਗੁਨ ਗਾਵੈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"By churning of the Athatvaveda, the guru-oriented (Kanad) in his Vaisesik recited about gunas, the qualities (of the matter).\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"bedh atharaban mathan kar gurmukh baasekhik gun gaavai|\",\"hi\":\"बेद अथरबनु मथनि करि गुरमुखि बासेखिक गुन गावै।\",\"ipa\":\"bed̪ ət̪ʰərəbən mət̪ʰən kər Gʊrəmʊkʰ bɑsekʰɪk Gʊn Gɑʋæ.\",\"ur\":\"بےد اتھربن متھن کر گُرمکھ باسےکھک گُن گاوَے۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,13,'B',',098,065,109,107,103,098,103,103,','bd AQrbn mQn kr grmK bsKk gn gv','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','bamkgbgg','bedh atharaban mathan kar guramukh baasekhik gun gaavai|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200112,'The jiva must understand that nothing happens of its own (and our ownselves are responsible for our good or bad actions) and hence nobody as good or bad should be lodged in mind.','Awpo kCU n hoveI burw Blw nih mMin vswvY[','Awpo kCU n hoveI burw Blw nih mMin vswvY[','ਆਪੋ ਕਛੂ ਨ ਹੋਵਈ ਬੁਰਾ ਭਲਾ ਨਹਿ ਮੰਨਿ ਵਸਾਵੈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"The jiva must understand that nothing happens of its own (and our ownselves are responsible for our good or bad actions) and hence nobody as good or bad should be lodged in mind.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"aapo kachhoo na hoviee buraa bhalaa neh ma(n)n vasaavai|\",\"hi\":\"आपो कछू न होवई बुरा भला नहि मंनि वसावै।\",\"ipa\":\"əɑpɔ kəɕu nə hɔʋei bʊrɑ ɓəlɑ nəh məŋn ʋəsɑʋæ.\",\"ur\":\"آپو کچھُو ن هووای بُرا بھلا نهِ منّ وساوَے۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,13,'B',',065,107,110,104,098,066,110,109,118,','Ap kC n hve br Bl nh mn vsv',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','aknhbbnmv','aapo kachhoo na hoviee buraa bhalaa neh ma(n)n vasaavai|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200115,'In the treta, the whole city  suffered because of one evil-doer and in dvapar this suffering was limited to the one family and the family underwent the igominy.','qRyqy ngrI pIVIAY duAwpir vMsu kuvMs kuhwvY[','qRyqy ngrI pIVIAY duAwpir vMsu kuvMs kuhwvY[','ਤ੍ਰੇਤੇ ਨਗਰੀ ਪੀੜੀਐ ਦੁਆਪਰਿ ਵੰਸੁ ਕੁਵੰਸ ਕੁਹਾਵੈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"In the treta, the whole city  suffered because of one evil-doer and in dvapar this suffering was limited to the one family and the family underwent the igominy.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"trete nagaree peeReeaai dhuaapar va(n)s kuva(n)s kuhaavai|\",\"hi\":\"त्रेते नगरी पीड़ीऐ दुआपरि वंसु कुवंस कुहावै।\",\"ipa\":\"t̪ɹet̪e nəGəri piɽiæ d̪ʊəɑpər ʋəŋs kʊʋəŋs kʊhɑʋæ.\",\"ur\":\"ترےتے نگری پیڑیاَے دُآپر وںس کُوںس کُهاوَے۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,13,'B',',113,110,112,100,118,107,107,','qq ngr pVA dApr vs kvs khv',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','tnpdvkk','trete nagaree peeReeaai dhuaapar va(n)s kuva(n)s kuhaavai|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200118,'Gurmukh Patanjali the (supposed) incarnation of the Sesnaga, very 