ng hand to hand.','hQo hQI pweIAY Bgiq jog kI pUr kmweI[','hQo hQI pweIAY Bgiq jog kI pUr kmweI[','ਹਥੋ ਹਥੀ ਪਾਈਐ ਭਗਤਿ ਜੋਗ ਕੀ ਪੂਰ ਕਮਾਈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"The complete achievement of yogic bhakti is that you every thing hand to hand.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"hatho hathee paieeaai bhagat jog kee poor kamaiee|\",\"hi\":\"हथो हथी पाईऐ भगति जोग की पूर कमाई।\",\"ipa\":\"hət̪ʰɔ hət̪ʰi pɑeiæ ɓəGət̪ d͡ʒɔG ki pur kəmɑei.\",\"ur\":\"هتھو هتھی پاایاَے بھگت جوگ کی پُور کماای۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,14,'B',',104,104,112,066,106,107,112,107,','hQ hQ peA Bgq jg k pr kme',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','hhpbjkpk','hatho hathee paieeaai bhagat jog kee poor kamaiee|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200127,'Since time immemorial, on account of the bondage of unfulfilled desires, the jiv has been suffering transmigration.','juig juig myru srIr kw bwsnw bDw AwvY jwvY[','juig juig myru srIr kw bwsnw bDw AwvY jwvY[','ਜੁਗਿ ਜੁਗਿ ਮੇਰੁ ਸਰੀਰ ਕਾ ਬਾਸਨਾ ਬਧਾ ਆਵੈ ਜਾਵੈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"Since time immemorial, on account of the bondage of unfulfilled desires, the jiv has been suffering transmigration.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"jug jug mer sareer kaa baasanaa badhaa aavai jaavai|\",\"hi\":\"जुगि जुगि मेरु सरीर का बासना बधा आवै जावै।\",\"ipa\":\"d͡ʒʊG d͡ʒʊG mer sərir kɑ bɑsənɑ bət̪ɑ əɑʋæ d͡ʒɑʋæ.\",\"ur\":\"جُگ جُگ مےر سریر کا باسنا بدھا آوَے جاوَے۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,15,'B',',106,106,109,115,107,098,098,065,106,','jg jg mr srr k bsn bD Av jv',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','jjmskbbaj','jug jug mer sareer kaa baasanaa badhaa aavai jaavai|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200130,'Getting caught in karma-bondage in treta','qRyqy krmW bWDqy duAwpir iPir Avqwr krwvY[','qRyqy krmW bWDqy duAwpir iPir Avqwr krwvY[','ਤ੍ਰੇਤੇ ਕਰਮਾਂ ਬਾਂਧਤੇ ਦੁਆਪਰਿ ਫਿਰਿ ਅਵਤਾਰ ਕਰਾਵੈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"Gettin