:\"kalijug kee sun saadhanaa karam kirat kee chalai naa kaiee|\",\"hi\":\"कलिजुग की सुण साधना करम किरति की चलै ना काई।\",\"ipa\":\"kəlɪd͡ʒʊG ki sʊɳ sɑt̪ənɑ kərəm kɪrət̪ ki t͡ʃəlæ nɑ kɑei.\",\"ur\":\"کلجگ کی سُن سادھنا کرم کرت کی چلَے نا کاای۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,16,'B',',107,107,115,115,107,107,107,099,110,107,','kljg k sx sDn krm krq k cl n ke','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','kksskkkcnk','kalijug kee sun saadhanaa karam kirat kee chalai naa kaiee|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200139,'Now if this opportunity slipped, no occasion and place would be made available.','pwieAw mwns dyih kau AYQO cuikAw TOr n TweI[','pwieAw mwns dyih kau AYQO cuikAw TOr n TweI[','ਪਾਇਆ ਮਾਨਸ ਦੇਹਿ ਕਉ ਐਥੌ ਚੁਕਿਆ ਠੌਰ ਨ ਠਾਈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"Now if this opportunity slipped, no occasion and place would be made available.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"paiaa maanas dheh kau aaithau chukiaa Thauar na Thaiee|\",\"hi\":\"पाइआ मानस देहि कउ ऐथौ चुकिआ ठौर न ठाई।\",\"ipa\":\"pɑɪɑ mɑnəs d̪eh ko æt̪ʰɒ t͡ʃʊkɪəɑ ʈʰɒər nə ʈʰɑei.\",\"ur\":\"پااآ مانس دےه کا اَےتھَو چُکآ ٹھَور ن ٹھاای۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,16,'B',',112,109,100,107,065,099,084,110,084,','peA mns dh ka AQ ckA Tr n Te',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','pmdkacTnT','paiaa maanas dheh kau aaithau chukiaa ttauar na ttaiee|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200142,'If somebody now, in spite of being a doer, erases from his self this sense and prefers to be called lowly, only then he can remain in the good books of the Lord.','kir ky nIc sdwvxw qW pRBu lyKY AMdir pweI[','kir ky nIc sdwvxw qW pRBu lyKY AMdir pweI[','ਕਰਿ ਕੇ ਨੀਚ ਸਦਾਵਣਾ ਤਾਂ ਪ੍ਰਭੁ ਲੇਖੈ ਅੰਦਰਿ ਪਾਈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"If somebody now, in spite of being a doer, erases from his self this sense and prefers to be called lowly, only then he can remain in the good books of the Lord.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\":