han neh agiaan gubaaraa|\",\"hi\":\"निंदिआ चले वेद की समझनि नहि अगिआनि गुबारा।\",\"ipa\":\"nɪŋd̪ɪəɑ t͡ʃəle ʋed̪ ki səməɖ͡ʐən nəh əGɪəɑn Gʊbɑrɑ.\",\"ur\":\"نِںدآ چلے وےد کی سمجھن نهِ اگآن گُبارا۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,17,'B',',110,099,118,107,115,110,065,103,','ndA cl vd k smJn nh AgAn gbr',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','ncvksnag','ni(n)dhiaa chale vedh kee samajhan neh agiaan gubaaraa|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200151,'The Guru and God are one; He is the true master and the whole world craves for Him.','gur prmysru ieku hY scw swhu jgqu bxjwrw[','gur prmysru ieku hY scw swhu jgqu bxjwrw[','ਗੁਰ ਪਰਮੇਸਰੁ ਇਕੁ ਹੈ ਸਚਾ ਸਾਹੁ ਜਗਤੁ ਬਣਜਾਰਾ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"The Guru and God are one; He is the true master and the whole world craves for Him.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"gur paramesar ik hai sachaa saahu jagat banajaaraa|\",\"hi\":\"गुर परमेसरु इकु है सचा साहु जगतु बणजारा।\",\"ipa\":\"Gʊr pərəmesər eɪk hæ sət͡ʃɑ sɑh d͡ʒəGət̪ bəɳəd͡ʒɑrɑ.\",\"ur\":\"گُر پرمےسر اک هَے سچا ساهُ جگت بنجارا۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,17,'B',',103,112,101,104,115,115,106,098,','gr prmsr ek h sc sh jgq bxjr','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','gpihssjb','gur paramesar ik hai sachaa saahu jagat banajaaraa|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200154,'In kalijug one finds intellectualism incarnate, but discriminating between knowledge and ignorance is nowhere.','kiljuig boDu Aauqwru hY boDu AboDu n idRstI AwvY[','kiljuig boDu Aauqwru hY boDu AboDu n idRstI AwvY[','ਕਲਿਜੁਗਿ ਬੋਧੁ ਅਉਤਾਰੁ ਹੈ ਬੋਧੁ ਅਬੋਧੁ ਨ ਦ੍ਰਿਸਟੀ ਆਵੈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"In kalijug one finds intellectualism incarnate, but discriminating between knowledge and ignorance is nowhere.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"kalijug bodh aautaar hai bodh abodh na dhirasaTee aavai|\",\"hi\":\"कलिजुगि बोधु अउतारु है बोधु अबोधु न दृसटी आवै।\",\"ipa\":\"kəlɪd͡ʒʊG b