u\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"varatiaa paap jagatr te dhaul uddeenaa nis dhin roaa|\",\"hi\":\"वरतिआ पापु जगतृ ते धउलु उडीणा निसि दिनि रोआ।\",\"ipa\":\"ʋərət̪ɪəɑ pɑp d͡ʒəGət̪ɪɹ t̪e t̪oʊl oʊɖiɳɑ nɪs d̪ɪn rɔəɑ.\",\"ur\":\"ورتآ پاپ جگتر تے دھال اُڈینا نس دنِ روآ۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,22,'B',',118,112,106,113,068,097,110,100,114,','vrqA pp jgq q Dal afx ns dn rA','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','vpjtdundr','varatiaa paap jagatir te dhaul auddeenaa nis dhin roaa|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200196,'Now this earth cannot be upheld without the saints and no saint is available in the world.','QMmy koie n swDu ibnu swDu n idsY jig ivic koAw[','QMmy koie n swDu ibnu swDu n idsY jig ivic koAw[','ਥੰਮੇ ਕੋਇ ਨ ਸਾਧੁ ਬਿਨੁ ਸਾਧੁ ਨ ਦਿਸੈ ਜਗਿ ਵਿਚਿ ਕੋਆ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"Now this earth cannot be upheld without the saints and no saint is available in the world.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"tha(n)me koi na saadh bin saadh na dhisai jag vich koaa|\",\"hi\":\"थंमे कोइ न साधु बिनु साधु न दिसै जगि विचि कोआ।\",\"ipa\":\"t̪ʰəŋme kɔeɪ nə sɑt̪ bɪn sɑt̪ nə d̪ɪsæ d͡ʒəG ʋɪt͡ʃ kɔəɑ.\",\"ur\":\"تھںمے کوا ن سادھ بن سادھ ن دسَے جگ وچِ کوآ۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,22,'B',',081,107,110,115,098,115,110,100,106,118,107,','Qm ke n sD bn sD n ds jg vc kA',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','tknsbsndjvk','tha(n)me koi na saadh bin saadh na dhisai jag vich koaa|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200199,'The benefactor Lord listened to the cries (of humanity) and sent Guru Nanak to this world.','suxI pukwir dwqwr pRBu guru nwnk jg mwih pTwieAw[','suxI pukwir dwqwr pRBu guru nwnk jg mwih pTwieAw[','ਸੁਣੀ ਪੁਕਾਰਿ ਦਾਤਾਰ ਪ੍ਰਭੁ ਗੁਰੁ ਨਾਨਕ ਜਗ ਮਾਹਿ ਪਠਾਇਆ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"The benefactor Lord listened to the cries (of humanity) and sent Guru Nanak to this world.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"su