iv chalanaa gursikh visekhai|\",\"hi\":\"गुरमुखि वरनु अवरनु होइ निवि चलणा गुरसिखि विसेखै।\",\"ipa\":\"Gʊrəmʊkʰ ʋərən əʋərən hɔeɪ nɪʋ t͡ʃələɳɑ Gʊrəsɪkʰ ʋɪsekʰæ.\",\"ur\":\"گُرمکھ ورن اورن هوا نو چلنا گُرسکھ وسےکھَے۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,25,'B',',103,118,065,104,110,099,103,118,','grmK vrn Avrn he nv clx grsK vsK','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','gvahncgv','guramukh varan avaran hoi niv chalanaa gurasikh visekhai|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200226,'Celebates, ascetics, immortal anchorites, the siddhs, naths and teacher- taughts were available in abundance.','jqI sqI icrujIvxy swiDk isD nwQ guru cyly[','jqI sqI icrujIvxy swiDk isD nwQ guru cyly[','ਜਤੀ ਸਤੀ ਚਿਰੁਜੀਵਣੇ ਸਾਧਿਕ ਸਿਧ ਨਾਥ ਗੁਰੁ ਚੇਲੇ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"Celebates, ascetics, immortal anchorites, the siddhs, naths and teacher- taughts were available in abundance.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"jatee satee chirujeevane saadhik sidh naath gur chele|\",\"hi\":\"जती सती चिरुजीवणे साधिक सिध नाथ गुरु चेले।\",\"ipa\":\"d͡ʒət̪i sət̪i t͡ʃɪrʊd͡ʒiʋəɳe sɑt̪ɪk sɪt̪ə̀ nɑt̪ʰ Gʊr t͡ʃele.\",\"ur\":\"جتی ستی چرجیونے سادھک سدھ ناتھ گُر چےلے۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,26,'B',',106,115,099,115,115,110,103,099,','jq sq crjvx sDk sD nQ gr cl',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','jscssngc','jatee satee chirujeevane saadhik sidh naath gur chele|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200229,'Seeing raksasas, demons, deities in their imagination, people were totally in the clutches of duality.','rwkis dwno dYq liK AMdir dUjw Bwau duhyly[','rwkis dwno dYq liK AMdir dUjw Bwau duhyly[','ਰਾਕਸਿ ਦਾਨੋ ਦੈਤ ਲਖਿ ਅੰਦਰਿ ਦੂਜਾ ਭਾਉ ਦੁਹੇਲੇ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"Seeing raksasas, demons, deities in their imagination, people were totally in the clutches of duality.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"raakas dhaano dhait lakh a(n)dhar dhoojaa bhaau dhuhele|\",\"hi\":\"राकसि दा