th the siddhs and because of th eenergy of the sabad those siddhs attained peace.','bwby kIqI isiD gosit sbid sWiq isDW ivic AweI[','bwby kIqI isiD gosit sbid sWiq isDW ivic AweI[','ਬਾਬੇ ਕੀਤੀ ਸਿਧਿ ਗੋਸਟਿ ਸਬਦਿ ਸਾਂਤਿ ਸਿਧਾਂ ਵਿਚਿ ਆਈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"Baba has discussions with the siddhs and because of th eenergy of the sabad those siddhs attained peace.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"baabe keetee sidh gosaT sabadh saa(n)t sidhaa(n) vich aaiee|\",\"hi\":\"बाबे कीती सिधि गोसटि सबदि साँति सिधाँ विचि आई।\",\"ipa\":\"bɑbe kit̪i sɪt̪ə̀ Gɔsəʈ səbəd̪ sɑⁿət̪ sɪt̪ɑⁿ ʋɪt͡ʃ əɑei.\",\"ur\":\"بابے کیتی سدھ گوسٹ سبد سWت سدھW وچِ آای۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,44,'B',',098,107,115,103,115,115,115,118,065,','bb kq sD gst sbd sq sD vc Ae',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','bksgsssva','baabe keetee sidh gosaT sabadh saa(n)t sidhaa(n) vich aaiee|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200391,'You, emerging like a  greatman in kaliyug have diffused the light (of knowledge) all around.','vfw purKu prgitAw kiljuig AMdir joiq jgweI[','vfw purKu prgitAw kiljuig AMdir joiq jgweI[','ਵਡਾ ਪੁਰਖੁ ਪਰਗਟਿਆ ਕਲਿਜੁਗਿ ਅੰਦਰਿ ਜੋਤਿ ਜਗਾਈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"You, emerging like a  greatman in kaliyug have diffused the light (of knowledge) all around.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": null, \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": null}, \"es\": {\"sn\": null}}','{\"en\":\"vaddaa purakh paragaTiaa kalijug a(n)dhar jot jagaiee|\",\"hi\":\"वडा पुरखु परगटिआ कलिजुगि अंदरि जोति जगाई।\",\"ipa\":\"ʋəɖɑ pʊrəkʰ pərəGəʈɪəɑ kəlɪd͡ʒʊG əŋd̪ər d͡ʒɔt̪ d͡ʒəGɑei.\",\"ur\":\"وڈا پُرکھ پرگٹآ کلجگ اںدر جوت جگاای۔\"}',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,44,'B',',118,112,112,107,065,106,106,','vf prK prgtA kljg Adr jq jge',NULL,'{\"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": [], \"sttm2\": []}',' ',' ','vppkajj','vaddaa purakh paragaTiaa kalijug a(n)dhar jot jagaiee|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200394,'Baba took out a jasmine flower from his bag and floated it on the milk (which meant that he wa not going to put anybody to trouble).','bwby kiF kir bgl qy cMbylI duiD ivic imlweI[','bwby kiF kir bgl qy cMbylI duiD ivic imlweI[','ਬਾਬੇ ਕਢਿ ਕਰਿ ਬਗਲ ਤੇ ਚੰਬੇਲੀ ਦੁਧਿ ਵਿਚਿ ਮਿਲਾਈ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"Baba took out a jasmine flower from his bag and floated it on the milk (which meant that he wa not going to put anybody to trouble).\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"baabe kadd kar bagal te cha(n)belee dhudh vich milaiee|\",\"hi\":\"बाबे कढि करि बगल ते चंबेली दुधि विचि मिलाई।\",\"ipa\":\"bɑbe kəʈə̀ kər bəGəl t̪e t͡ʃəŋbeli d̪ʊt̪ə̀ ʋɪt͡ʃ mɪlɑei.\",\"ur\":\"بابے کڈھ کرِ بگل تے چںبےلی دُدھ وچِ ملاای۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,44,'B',',098,107,107,098,113,099,100,118,109,','bb kF kr bgl q cbl dD vc mle','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','bkkbtcdvm','baabe kadd kar bagal te cha(n)belee dhudh vich milaiee|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200397,'After the journey of Multan, Baba Nanak again turned towards Kartarpur.','jwriq kir mulqwn dI iPir krqwirpury no AwieAw[','jwriq kir mulqwn dI iPir krqwirpury no AwieAw[','ਜਾਰਤਿ ਕਰਿ ਮੁਲਤਾਨ ਦੀ ਫਿਰਿ ਕਰਤਾਰਿਪੁਰੇ ਨੋ ਆਇਆ।','{\"en\": {\"bdb\": \"After the journey of Multan, Baba Nanak again turned towards Kartarpur.\"}, \"pu\": {\"ss\": \"\", \"ft\": \"\"}, \"puu\": {\"ss\": \"\"}, \"es\": {\"sn\": \"\"}}','{\"en\":\"jaarat kar mulataan dhee fir karataaripure no aaiaa|\",\"hi\":\"जारति करि मुलतान दी फिरि करतारिपुरे नो आइआ।\",\"ipa\":\"d͡ʒɑrət̪ kər mʊlət̪ɑn d̪i fɪr kərət̪ɑrɪpʊre nɔ əɑɪɑ.\",\"ur\":\"جارت کر مُلتان دی پھرِ کرتارپرے نو آيا۔\"}',22,'','','',0,1,45,'B',',106,107,109,100,080,107,110,065,','jrq kr mlqn d Pr krqrpr n AeA','','{\"sttm2\": [], \"sttm\": [], \"igurbani\": []}',' ',' ','jkmdfkna','jaarat kar mulataan dhee fir karataaripure no aaiaa|','2019-12-29 01:37:36',1),(200400,'In the world, he established the authority (of his doctrines) and started a religion, devoid of any impurity (niramal panth).','mwirAw iskw jgiq ivic nwnk inrml pMQu cl